sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Customer (SPA)
  participant G as API Gateway (JWT)
  participant T as transfer λ
  participant I as idempotency table
  participant A as account λ
  participant F as fraud λ
  participant L as ledger λ
  participant D as DynamoDB (TransactWriteItems)
  C->>G: POST /v1/transfers + Idempotency-Key ($250.00 = 25000)
  G->>T: verified claims (sub, scope)
  T->>T: strict validation; customer_id from IDENTITY#sub
  T->>I: conditional put CUSTOMER#id / REQUEST#key (IN_PROGRESS, request_hash)
  alt key exists
    I-->>T: same hash → stored outcome / different hash → 422
  end
  T->>A: get_for_transfer(source, destination)
  A-->>T: owner, status, currency
  T->>D: put transfer SCREENING + outbox TransferRequested
  T->>F: screen(transfer, context)
  F-->>T: decision, score, rules, policy_version (stored server-side)
  alt REJECTED / PENDING_REVIEW
    T->>D: state → REJECTED / PENDING_REVIEW + outbox event (no balance change)
  else APPROVED
    T->>D: state → APPROVED_FOR_POSTING
    T->>L: post_transfer(transfer_id = journal_id)
    L->>D: ONE transaction: source -= 25000 if ≥ 25000 & ACTIVE & owner & USD;<br/>dest += 25000 if ACTIVE & USD; 2 immutable entries; journal header (not exists);<br/>POSTING#id (not exists); transfer APPROVED_FOR_POSTING→COMPLETED; outbox TransferCompleted
    D-->>L: all-or-nothing
    L-->>T: posted (or replayed)
  end
  T->>I: complete(response)
  T-->>C: 201 COMPLETED / 202 PENDING_REVIEW / 422
